  extend the school day  for lots of additional teaching of  academic subjects  and you get a really diminishing return  children won't learn well if they're  tired and if it's been a long school day  but i do absolutely want to see schools  being supported with the resources to  extend their facilities  beyond the end of the day for perhaps  local and  sports clubs youth groups to come in and  use those facilities  so that we can offer those broader  activities for children and young people  that are so crucial  for their social and emotional  development and indeed for their  learning  okay kate green thank you for your time  this morning  thank you
 

